                                     "text":  "The space, surrounded by plants, was very relaxing.\n\nWe ordered pizza, mint tea, a bitter tea oil chicken soup set meal, and a salted egg yolk cheesecake. The flavors were on the lighter side, and all were quite good.\n\nSince I was working alone, the food took a bit longer to arrive, but that\u0027s understandable.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "被植物包圍的空間，很放鬆。\n\n點了披薩、薄荷茶、苦茶油雞湯套餐跟鹹蛋黃起司蛋糕，口味偏清淡，都很不錯。\n\n一人作業，上餐比較慢，不過可理解。",
